    "title": "Telemundo 51 Miami: Noticias",
    "description": "Telemundo 51 Miami's redesigned news and weather app connects you to the best local content, the most accurate weather forecasts, breaking news, live TV and investigative journalism. \r\n\r\n\r\nYOUR ACCURATE MIAMI WEATHER FORECAST \r\n\r\n+ Customizable weather home screen with weather modules that you can rearrange\r\n+ Improved location center to add new locations and set weather alerts\r\n+ Exclusive real-time radar\r\n+ 10-day forecast for your region \r\n+ Hourly forecasts with customizable graphs \r\n+ Detailed forecast information including UV index and dew point \r\n+ Weather alerts for Miami and South Florida\r\n+ Information about school closures due to bad weather in Miami-Dade, Broward and Palm Beach counties \r\n\r\nNEWS, TRAFFIC AND LIVE VIDEO ALERTS\r\n\r\n+ Personalized alerts for local, national and international news including Cuba and Venezuela \r\n+ Breaking news section showing articles in reverse chronological order \r\n+ Alert center showing the most important news and trends in South Florida\r\n+ Watch live Telemundo 51 newscasts and other streaming content\r\n+ Specific section of political news, videos, entertainment and total access\r\n\r\nTELEMUNDO INVESTIGATIONS RESPONSE AND MORE \r\n\r\n+ Telemundo 51 Investiga's award-winning reports\r\n+ Telemundo 51 Responde solve your problems as a consumer and fight to get your money back\r\n+ CNBC Financial News\r\n+ Local and national news from NBC South Florida\r\n\r\nTelemundo 51 Miami's news and weather app includes proprietary Nielsen measurement software that will allow you to contribute to market research, such as Nielsen's TV Ratings. Please visit www.nielsen.com/digitalprivacy for more information. \r\n\r\nYour privacy options: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/notrtoo-spanish?brandA=Owned_Stations&intake=Telemundo_51        \r\nCalifornia Notice: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy-policy/aviso-de-california?intake=Telemundo_51                                                                                    \r\n\r\n****** \r\n\r\nTelemundo 51 Miami's redesigned news and weather app connects you to the best local content, the most accurate weather forecasts, breaking news, live TV and investigative journalism. \r\n\r\nYOUR ACCURATE MIAMI WEATHER FORECAST \r\n\r\n+ Exclusive real-time radar\r\n+ 10-day forecast for your region \r\n+ Hourly forecasts with customizable graphics \r\n+ Detailed forecast information including UV index and dew point \r\n+ Weather alerts for Miami and South Florida.\r\n+School weather closings information for Miami-Dade, Broward and Palm Beach counties \r\n\r\nLIVE NEWS ALERTS, TRAFFIC UPDATES AND VIDEO\r\n\r\n+ Customized alerts for local, national, and international news including covering Cuba and Venezuela\r\n+ Breaking news section that displays articles in reverse chronological order \r\n+ Live alert center that displays the most important news and trends in South Florida\r\n+ Watch live Telemundo 51 newscasts and other streaming content\r\n+ Specific section for political news, videos, entertainment and full access\r\n\r\nTELEMUNDO RESPONDS INVESTIGATIONS AND MORE \r\n\r\n+ Telemundo 51 Investiga's award-winning newscasts and reports\r\n+ Telemundo 51 Responds solves your consumer problems and fights for your money back\r\n+ Business news from CNBC\r\n+ Local and national news from NBC South Florida",
